commits.message:
llama.mak: fix build-info generation

Upstream commit 6990e2f1 changed common/build-info.cpp.in from just defining globals:

int LLAMA_BUILD_NUMBER = ...;
char const *LLAMA_COMMIT = ...;

to also defining functions:

int llama_build_number(void)
const char * llama_commit(void)
const char * llama_build_info(void)

To fix this, now we generate w64dk-build-info.cpp from the provided
common/build-info.cpp.in template.

gcc: Fix compound literals ICE

int g(){__builtin_strlen((static struct{char i,d[]}){0,0}.d);}

Via gardenweb.
